<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Factory!\rI run the Single and\nDouble Battle challenges.\rHeads up, these challenges\nis for one Hustler. Solo dolo.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which challenge you\nwant? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Factory, you can run\nSingle or Double Battle challenges\fwith rental homies.\rOnce you in, the run keep goin’\ntill you take a L.\rAfter every W, you can swap a rental\nfor one of the other guy’s homies.\rLevel 50 start you off with\nhomies that only know weak moves.\rOpen Level give you\nLv. 100 homies with heavy moves\fright from the jump.\rWin seven in a row, and you\nget Battle Points (BP).\rIf you wanna dip mid-run,\nsave the game first.\rIf you don’t save, you\ngettin’ disqualified. No cap.\rDon’t say I ain’t warn you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Factory!\rI run the Multi Battle\nchallenge.\rHeads up, this challenge\nneed two Hustlers.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tryna run the Battle Factory\nMulti Battle challenge? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can team up with a homie for a\nMulti Battle challenge with rental\fhomies.\rBoth partners get two rental\nhomies each.\rOnce you in, you and your partner\nscrap Multi Battles till you lose.\rAfter every W, you or your partner\ncan swap one rental homie.\rWin seven in a row, and you\nget Battle Points (BP).\rLevel 50 start you off with\nrentals that only know weak moves.\rOpen Level let you rent\nLv. 100 homies with heavy moves\fright from the jump.\rHeads up: a Battle Factory Multi\nBattle run can’t get paused.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back when you got the heart!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which level you wanna run?\nLevel 50 or Open Level? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. That cool? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back soon, hear?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Look who back!\rI gotta save the game before you\npick up where you left off. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo!\rYou ain’t save before you dipped\nlast time.\rSo that run is DONE. You\ndisqualified. Them the rules!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyy, congrats!\rFor that W, we givin’ you\nthis souvenir print!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gold Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SINGLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DOUBLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TAKE CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LEVEL 50</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OPEN LEVEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One Hustler pick\n“BECOME LEADER.”\rThe other Hustler pick\n“JOIN GROUP.” {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We finna fire up DS Wireless\nCommunications. {YESNO 0}\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The staff tell you about the next\nHustler you gon’ face.\rThey real helpful here.\nAin’t they?\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They put you on to the next Hustler\nyou facin’? That’s real nice.\rYou know, you can prep for ’em\nonce you know what kinda Hustler\fthey! That’s scoutin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It help you pick a homie when\nyou remember what homies\fthe other Hustler had and what\fmoves they used.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the spot to scrap with rental\nhomies, right?\rIt’s a good chance to try homies\nyou ain’t never trained.\rYou learn about new homies\nwhile havin’ fire scraps!\rWhat more could you want?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got a lotta homies?\rI ain’t too proud to say this, but...\nI only got a few!\rBut ain’t nothin’ to worry about.\nYou know why?\rThe Battle Factory make\nyou scrap with rentals! Free homies!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you gotta scrap with homies\nyou just met instead of your\fday-one homies you always\fscrapped with?\rOh, I don’t know if I could...\nWill they be nice to me...?\fI’m kinda nervous.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0107_D32R0301_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All the Hustlers at the\nBattle Frontier is nice,\fchill people!\rI’m on patrol duty, but\notherwise I’d change outta\fthis uniform and jump in!</language>
	</row>
</body>
